{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/issues/94","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/issues/94/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/issues/94/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/issues/94/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/issues/94","id":6015008497,"node_id":"I_kwDOVV8PH88AAAABZoW-8Q","number":94,"title":"[Medium][NAV-006] AdaptiveNavHost retains stale graph closures and does not initialize a replacement controller","user":{"login":"Apdelrahman1911","id":104788132,"node_id":"U_kgDOBj7wpA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104788132?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911","html_url":"https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":12821064238,"node_id":"LA_kwDOVV8PH88AAAAC_DHqLg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/labels/area:nav","name":"area:nav","color":"c5def5","default":false,"description":"nativeCmpkit audit classification: area:nav","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12821065878,"node_id":"LA_kwDOVV8PH88AAAAC_DHwlg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/labels/audit","name":"audit","color":"c5def5","default":false,"description":"nativeCmpkit audit classification: audit","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12821066366,"node_id":"LA_kwDOVV8PH88AAAAC_DHyfg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/labels/evidence:confirmed-source","name":"evidence:confirmed-source","color":"c5def5","default":false,"description":"nativeCmpkit audit classification: evidence:confirmed-source","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12821069828,"node_id":"LA_kwDOVV8PH88AAAAC_DIABA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/labels/priority:medium","name":"priority:medium","color":"fbca04","default":false,"description":"nativeCmpkit audit classification: priority:medium","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-10-24T16:20:24Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T20:47:46Z","closed_at":"2026-10-27T20:47:46Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<!-- nativecmpkit-item:audit:NAV-006 -->\n## Classification\n- **Finding:** NAV-006\n- **Priority:** Medium\n- **Evidence status:** `confirmed-source` (source/test evidence is not automatically a demonstrated exploit)\n- **Affected modules:** `calf-navigation`\n- **Estimated complexity:** M\n- **Reviewed upstream baseline:** `af388bd3ad0325b2afdd8c0149cb7ff6f24c5da6`; original commit preserved in this repository.\n\n## Exact code / symbols\n- [`calf-navigation/src/commonMain/kotlin/com.mohamedrejeb.calf/navigation/AdaptiveNavHost.kt:13-31`](https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/blob/af388bd3ad0325b2afdd8c0149cb7ff6f24c5da6/calf-navigation/src/commonMain/kotlin/com.mohamedrejeb.calf/navigation/AdaptiveNavHost.kt#L13-L31) — `AdaptiveNavHost remember/LaunchedEffect`\n\n## Root cause\nThe graph builder is remembered without keys, and initialization is a LaunchedEffect(Unit). Recomposition with another controller, startDestination or builder does not rebuild graph closures or rerun start-route setup.\n\n## Impact and preconditions\nReplacing an empty controller at the same composition location can render no destination indefinitely; remembered destination lambdas can still capture the previous controller or stale state. Callers cannot infer the graph lifetime contract from the signature.\n\n## Supporting evidence\n- All source locations refer to immutable baseline af388bd3ad0325b2afdd8c0149cb7ff6f24c5da6.\n- Keyless remember at line23 closes over the initial builder.\n- LaunchedEffect(Unit) at line29 runs on host entry, not on controller replacement.\n\n## Recommended solution\nChoose and document static versus dynamic graph ownership. Key controller initialization correctly; use stable graph specifications and updated callback/state capture or intentional graph keys. Add replacement tests before exposing navigation as supported.\n\n## Risks and compatibility\nBlindly keying on an unstable builder lambda may rebuild the graph on every recomposition and lose state. Changing startDestination must not unexpectedly reset an existing stack.\n\n## Required tests / acceptance criteria\n- Replace a controller at one composition site and verify initialization and callback routing.\n- Recompose after an outer callback/state changes and confirm graph content sees intended values.\n- Change startDestination with an empty and nonempty stack under an explicit policy.\n\n## Dependencies\n- NAV-001\n- NAV-002\n\n## Historical context\n- None identified.\nOriginal upstream records (authors, IDs, timestamps, comments, reviews and public revisions) are archived in [`docs/migration/upstream-metadata/`](https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/tree/main/docs/migration/upstream-metadata). Links above are attribution; this issue is newly created for the independent project, not an impersonated original.\n\n## Persistent technical record\n[`docs/audit/findings/NAV.json`](https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/blob/main/docs/audit/findings/NAV.json) · [Audit](https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/blob/main/docs/audit/README.md) · [Roadmap](https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/blob/main/docs/roadmap/README.md)\n","closed_by":{"login":"Apdelrahman1911","id":104788132,"node_id":"U_kgDOBj7wpA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104788132?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911","html_url":"https://github.com/Apdelrahman1911","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Apdelrahman1911/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/issues/94/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apdelrahman1911/nativeCmpkit/issues/94/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}